	// Player characters can be added only in SETUP.
	//
	// Errors:
	//   - `not_found`: a participant is not a living character of the campaign.
	//   - `permission_denied`: the caller is a player.
	//   - `invalid_argument`: no participants, more than 40 combatants in all,
